  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "When S<sub>1</sub> is closed,<br />charge on&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>C</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mn>2</mn> <msub> <mtext>V</mtext> <mn>0</mn> </msub> <mtext>C</mtext> </mrow> </math><br />After S<sub>2</sub> is closed, half of the change will move to C<sub>2</sub><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;</mo> </mrow> </math> charge on <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>C</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mn>2</mn> <msub> <mtext>V</mtext> <mn>0</mn> </msub> <mtext>C</mtext> </mrow> </math><br />when S<sub>2</sub> is closed,<br />charge on <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>C</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <msub> <mtext>V</mtext> <mn>0</mn> </msub> <mtext>C</mtext> </mrow> </math> but with reversed polarity,<br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;</mo> </mrow> </math> Charge on upper plate <math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mtext>V</mtext> <mn>0</mn> </msub> <mtext>C</mtext> </mrow> </math>",
    "image": null
  },
